OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main hits homes and
OL,4,Acloses schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome homes are without water and
OL,7,Fschools have been forced to close in
OL,8,Fparts of Surrey after an outage caused
OL,9,Fby a "large burst water main".
OL,11,FThames Water said it was investigating
OL,12,Fthe issue, first reported at about
OL,13,F05:15 BST, affecting Thames Ditton,
OL,14,FEsher, and Sunbury, plus other parts of
OL,15,Fthe county and South West London.
OL,17,FLong Ditton Infant and Nursery School
OL,18,Fand Thames Ditton Infant School said on
OL,19,Ftheir websites they had closed for the
OL,20,Fday as they were without a supply.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
